{"logId": "e244ca47-9620-4a27-99e5-1f68ccb0dd18", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——居家", "block_bbox": [372, 121, 794, 164], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[372.0, 121.0], [794.0, 121.0], [794.0, 164.0], [372.0, 164.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "四级【3~4分】：根据个人经济能力、岗位级别等达到相应的居家品味。（品味）", "block_bbox": [364, 226, 1330, 258], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[364.0, 226.0], [1330.0, 226.0], [1330.0, 258.0], [364.0, 258.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：根据个人或家庭经济收入，合理科学地规划最符合自身的居家（住房面积、住房位置、住房价格、装修品质、社区环境、居民素质等），保证居家各方面条件的匹配和心理舒适度，调整到最佳的居家状态上。", "block_bbox": [360, 293, 1609, 413], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[360.0, 293.0], [1609.0, 293.0], [1609.0, 413.0], [360.0, 413.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "- 符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [364, 447, 534, 478], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[364.0, 447.0], [534.0, 447.0], [534.0, 478.0], [364.0, 478.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、相匹配的居家品质和居家品味", "block_bbox": [388, 495, 781, 526], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[388.0, 495.0], [781.0, 495.0], [781.0, 526.0], [388.0, 526.0]]}, {"block_label": "table", "block_content": "<table><tr><td>级别</td><td>居家品质及品味</td><td>标准</td></tr><tr><td>员工</td><td>安全、舒适、生活气息</td><td>（1）安全、舒适、分类清晰 （2）理解生活、有生活气息</td></tr><tr><td>课级</td><td>功能、实用、温馨</td><td>（1）居家氛围温暖、温馨，家具及窗帘、地毯、床品等装饰和谐搭配 （2）注重居家的功能和实用</td></tr><tr><td>处级</td><td>简洁、健康、时尚</td><td>（1）居家简洁、做到良好的断舍离 （2）居家用品健康、时尚，有对生活品质的要求和体验</td></tr><tr><td>店级</td><td>品质、轻松、品味、休闲</td><td>（1）居家硬装的细节品质良好、追求一定的工艺水平和标准，配备新风、中央空调等 （2）居家软装简洁不复杂、整体氛围轻快明朗、灯光温馨 （3）家具、卫浴、厨具等选择大品牌、经久耐用、有质感 （4）居家用品健康、有品味 （5）电器设备功能齐全、根据喜好有相应的休闲或娱乐（如茶台、小花园、露台、家庭影院、书吧、棋牌等）</td></tr></table>", "block_bbox": [432, 534, 1573, 906], "block_id": 5, "block_order": null, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[432.0, 534.0], [1573.0, 534.0], [1573.0, 906.0], [432.0, 906.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[47]", "block_bbox": [968, 971, 1020, 995], "block_id": 6, "block_order": null, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[968.0, 971.0], [1019.0, 971.0], [1019.0, 994.0], [968.0, 994.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8537694811820984, "coordinate": [372, 121, 794, 164], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[372.0, 121.0], [794.0, 121.0], [794.0, 164.0], [372.0, 164.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.6036186814308167, "coordinate": [364, 226, 1330, 258], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[364.0, 226.0], [1330.0, 226.0], [1330.0, 258.0], [364.0, 258.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9506825804710388, "coordinate": [360, 293, 1609, 413], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[360.0, 293.0], [1609.0, 293.0], [1609.0, 413.0], [360.0, 413.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.807475209236145, "coordinate": [364, 447, 534, 478], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[364.0, 447.0], [534.0, 447.0], [534.0, 478.0], [364.0, 478.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.4918757379055023, "coordinate": [388, 495, 781, 526], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[388.0, 495.0], [781.0, 495.0], [781.0, 526.0], [388.0, 526.0]]}, {"cls_id": 21, "label": "table", "score": 0.9773643612861633, "coordinate": [432, 534, 1573, 906], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[432.0, 534.0], [1573.0, 534.0], [1573.0, 906.0], [432.0, 906.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.702572762966156, "coordinate": [968, 971, 1020, 995], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[968.0, 971.0], [1019.0, 971.0], [1019.0, 994.0], [968.0, 994.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 考评奖励标准——居家\n\n## 四 级【3~4分】：根据个人经济能力、岗位级别等达到相应的居家品味。（品味）\n\n- 本条释义：根据个人或家庭经济收入，合理科学地规划最符合自身的居家（住房面积、住房位置、住房价格、装修品质、社区环境、居民素质等），保证居家各方面条件的匹配和心理舒适度，调整到最佳的居家状态上。\n\n## - 符合的行为：\n\n1、相匹配的居家品质和居家品味\n\n\n<table border=1 style='margin: auto; word-wrap: break-word;'><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>级别</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>居家品质及品味</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>标准</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>员工</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>安全、舒适、生活气息</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>（1）安全、舒适、分类清晰 （2）理解生活、有生活气息</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>课级</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>功能、实用、温馨</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>（1）居家氛围温暖、温馨，家具及窗帘、地毯、床品等装饰和谐搭配 （2）注重居家的功能和实用</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>处级</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>简洁、健康、时尚</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>（1）居家简洁、做到良好的断舍离 （2）居家用品健康、时尚，有对生活品质的要求和体验</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>店级</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>品质、轻松、品味、休闲</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>（1）居家硬装的细节品质良好、追求一定的工艺水平和标准，配备新风、中央空调等 （2）居家软装简洁不复杂、整体氛围轻快明朗、灯光温馨 （3）家具、卫浴、厨具等选择大品牌、经久耐用、有质感 （4）居家用品健康、有品味 （5）电器设备功能齐全、根据喜好有相应的休闲或娱乐（如茶台、小花园、露台、家庭影院、书吧、棋牌等）</td></tr></table>", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//e244ca47-9620-4a27-99e5-1f68ccb0dd18/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A29%3A43Z%2F-1%2F%2F29bb2623a25a09a08ed9ab19fb730c880bb6ad496e7a9f45ffbfe1ea5f528c2a"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//e244ca47-9620-4a27-99e5-1f68ccb0dd18/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A29%3A43Z%2F-1%2F%2F6c9885c23f2716681a329e876642f9220de31c147cb59dd100dd68ec95cd94a1"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1920, "height": 1080}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//e244ca47-9620-4a27-99e5-1f68ccb0dd18/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A29%3A43Z%2F-1%2F%2Ffc1165e6a647c407e4715b4dc7578fa8a3725b789cd1d127f066781c58cf7cba"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
